- `T5: after a revoke a mapping-only save needs a new token` - save scim with `TOKEN`; `POST /scim-token/revoke` (200); save `{ mode: 'scim', groupMappings: [mapping('cc3')] }` with the fresh version: 400 `INVALID_SCIM_TOKEN`; the stored token is falsy.
